king news":[4.729,1.353],"Breaking news: the storm is coming.":[6.532,3.036],"announce":[10.018,0.97],"The company announced new rules today.":[11.438,2.491],"launch":[14.379,0.819],"They launched a new product this week.":[15.648,2.618],"government":[18.716,0.947],"The government released a report.":[20.113,2.119],"warn":[22.682,0.691],"Scientists warn about climate change.":[23.823,2.909],"according to":[27.182,1.225],"According to the news, it will rain.":[28.857,2.514],"face a problem":[31.821,1.272],"The city is facing a water problem.":[33.542,2.433],"Did you see the news today?":[36.425,2.061],"Yes, I saw the headlines.":[38.936,2.259],"According to the news, a storm is coming. Are you worried?":[41.645,4.18],"A little. I\u0027m going to stay home.":[46.275,2.508],"Good idea. Scientists warn us to be careful. What do you usually read?":[49.233,5.394],"I usually read news on my phone.":[55.077,2.688],"Great talk! Stay safe!":[58.215,2.427]},"opinions":{"In my opinion":[0.45,1.248],"In my opinion, English is very useful.":[2.148,3.036],"I agree":[5.635,1.016],"I agree with you completely.":[7.101,1.922],"I disagree":[9.473,1.272],"Sorry, but I disagree.":[11.194,2.119],"That\u0027s a good point":[13.764,1.388],"That\u0027s a good point. I didn\u0027t think of that.":[15.601,3.217],"On the other hand":[19.268,1.318],"The city is big. On the other hand, it\u0027s expensive.":[21.036,3.844],"However":[25.33,0.842],"It was raining. However, we went out.":[26.622,2.845],"It depends":[29.917,1.144],"Is it expensive? It depends on the season.":[31.511,3.089],"I\u0027m not sure about that":[35.05,1.62],"Hmm, I\u0027m not sure about that.":[37.12,2.444],"Let\u0027s debate! Do you think everyone should learn English?":[40.014,4.122],"In my opinion, yes. It\u0027s very useful.":[44.586,3.275],"That\u0027s a good point. But some people say it\u0027s too difficult. What do you think?":[48.311,5.104],"I disagree. It\u0027s difficult, however it\u0027s possible.":[53.864,3.62